<title>USA: RESEARCH ALERT - Regency Health started.</title>
<headline>RESEARCH ALERT - Regency Health started.</headline>
<dateline>NEW YORK 1997-06-06</dateline>
<text>
<p>Bear Stearns initiated coverage of Regency Health Services Inc as attractive, a Bear Stearns source said.</p>
<p>-- Bear Stearns analyst A.J. Rice was not immediately available to provide additional details.</p>
<p>-- Regency gained 1/8 to 13-1/8.</p>
